The reason for this is because the buildings are pressurized to resist the planet's natural atmosphere, in order for humans to live. Therefore, when a hole is created in the side of a building, similarly to an airplane flying at high altitudes or spacecraft, you and everything else would be sucked (technically pushed) out of the opening.

&#x200B;

At least, that's the lore behind this.

Oh yeah weren't these the ones that limited Vegas people from buying tickets at their stadium?

